WEBVTT

NOTE Captions sit near the bottom of the picture, above the disclosure panel in the closing scene. The final caption sits at the top.

00:00.000 --> 00:02.700 line:90% size:90%
We support Pasadena's firefighters
and paramedics.

00:03.100 --> 00:04.200 line:90% size:90%
We always will.

00:04.600 --> 00:06.200 line:90% size:90%
But this year, Pasadena families

00:06.200 --> 00:07.800 line:90% size:90%
are already staring down
higher grocery,

00:08.100 --> 00:09.750 line:90% size:90%
insurance, and utility bills.

00:10.100 --> 00:12.000 line:90% size:90%
Now Measure PFD adds one more.

00:12.300 --> 00:15.100 line:90% size:90%
$304 a year on a typical home,

00:15.100 --> 00:17.300 line:90% size:90%
resulting in more than $1,700

00:17.300 --> 00:19.850 line:90% size:90%
in new taxes since 2020
for many households,

00:20.200 --> 00:22.820 line:55% size:90%
and a sales tax increase
arriving October 1st.

00:22.900 --> 00:24.400 line:55% size:90%
Supporting firefighters doesn't mean

00:24.400 --> 00:27.020 line:55% size:90%
saying yes to every bill
labeled public safety.

00:27.020 --> 00:29.200 line:3% size:90%
Vote no on Measure PFD.
